  @case 'genDiamond: the prime limit filters in place, and leaves a tritone hole'  [pure]  @ 665-676
  @case 'genRank2: pure-fifth size 7 / up 5 is Pythagorean major, 1/1 first'  [pure]  @ 680-686
  @case 'genRank2: size 4 / up 2 matches the Scale Workshop worked example'  [pure]  @ 690-695
  @case 'genRank2: irrational (EDO-step) generator emits cents tokens'  [pure]  @ 699-704
  @case 'nextMosSize / mosInfo: pure-fifth ladder 2->3->5->7->12; 7 is 5L 2s'  [pure]  @ 708-720
  @case 'coords: the exponents of the odd primes, prime 2 divided out'  [pure]  @ 724-734
  @case 'coords: an unreduced token reads as the interval it states'  [pure]  @ 738-743
  @case 'coords: a token that is not a ratio carries none'  [pure]  @ 747-753
  @case 'isTarget: a temper whose every pitch factorises, and nothing else'  [pure]  @ 757-765
  @case 'shortlist: the key step holds the unison, and the tonic does not move'  [pure]  @ 769-787
  @case 'shortlist: the rival spellings of a step, nearest first'  [pure]  @ 791-807
  @case 'shortlist: the hole at the tritone is the target\'s, not the step\'s'  [pure]  @ 811-822
  @case 'shortlist: an unequal notation strains by the side the point lies on'  [pure]  @ 826-838
  @case 'shortlist: a strand takes the intersection of its notes, and the strain of the worst'  [pure]  @ 842-866

